SUMMARY:Save the date: Personal Finance Summit
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for SABEW’s Personal Finance Summit\, hosted by The New York Times and co-sponsored by the Society for Advancing Business Editing and Writing (SABEW) and the National Endowment for Financial Education (NEFE) on Friday\, October 9. \nAdditional details will be posted as they become available. Add the date to your calendar for this event\, you won’t want to miss it!
URL:https://sabew.org/event/save-the-date-personal-finance-summit/
END:VEVENT
